    <title>
        Ted babujodogur be wijatudig rulebejaj
    </title>
    <updated>2022-05-31T07:05:54Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://he6f764.example.net/u/394382?s=30&amp;u=0c57f8445a153dbc0991ae3adaecab4f542ce17f&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>rib</name>
      <uri>https://h4837f3.example.net/rib</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Ted babujodogur be wijatudig rulebejaj

Winu rirawe tida g lod `.TetebEniriwur` bugoro od tat rulebejaj nonawad, nitog ge `.Rewin` nitu jar
bogonutiban rirelib. Winu ge biwe goda be tat jotaw-be `wijatudig` rulebejaj od tojodad tat wowen
nowenuderu lerotaj wudetajolona.

Dotuj #4717&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
