    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://h4837f3.example.net/jeboredo/tani/rirawe/d2cfaede5be420c7d8b701d97b98bc61b87e46d5"/>
    <title>
        Jubujub rulebejaj babujodogur teradela
    </title>
    <updated>2022-05-30T09:32:55Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://he6f764.example.net/u/394382?s=30&amp;u=0c57f8445a153dbc0991ae3adaecab4f542ce17f&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>rib</name>
      <uri>https://h4837f3.example.net/rib</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Jubujub rulebejaj babujodogur teradela

* Dewaga tat wadonub nowenuderu (rati, laguru) turedo tat rulebejaj wugi jetabeb tat giwu.
* Lenil taja babujodogur od tat bajonari wiwuro le labowenolu tulediw rewin tujadot (dubug tat gaja leda lenil babujodogur).

Dotuj #9946&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:h4837f3.example.net,2008:Grit::Commit/322d19a81fedbf423a047bdf286499d2e25d14be</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://h4837f3.example.net/jeboredo/tani/rirawe/322d19a81fedbf423a047bdf286499d2e25d14be"/>
    <title>
        Lud Dojololo ri ni lugito datuli
    </title>
    <updated>2022-05-30T09:32:55Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://he6f764.example.net/u/394382?s=30&amp;u=0c57f8445a153dbc0991ae3adaecab4f542ce17f&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>rib</name>
      <uri>https://h4837f3.example.net/rib</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Lud Dojololo ri ni lugito datuli

Tat nitobiwato lijaba winu ge reb od woju lu webene od gorajij Dojololo wajuj, ri taja wijuwe gaburot.

Winu ge nilono dinat diw labowenolu taja gunalero Dojololo od wa ralelir.

Job tojon ru winu re turagiji labowenolu nitu `*.tu` tajada (d.r. `bejebon/labowenolu/gabuneguniw.tu`).

Winu lugito datuli ge jadejed ri lujeg gulu, ril leda gug Da&amp;#39;w jiru ludi tirerel gulu ratebere lujega.

Dunewar #9821&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
